{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Summons Sword: Pot Guardian",
    "steam_appid": 3341330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here on a floating island high in the sky, Mana the summoner begins her adventure as she sets out to reclaim the &quot;Clay Pot of Darkness&quot; from an evil summoner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a top-down action game with high difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a stage-based 3D game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.Teleport anytime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even during an attack or when unable to act, you can consume MP to teleport nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.Can summon almost any enemy as an ally.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an enemy, they will drop an item (summon ball) that allows you to summon that enemy as an ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies do not drop items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.You can get weapons used by enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an enemy, the weapon they are using will drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies do not drop certain items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard, mouse, and gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad recommended.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here on a floating island high in the sky, Mana the summoner begins her adventure as she sets out to reclaim the &quot;Clay Pot of Darkness&quot; from an evil summoner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a top-down action game with high difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a stage-based 3D game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.Teleport anytime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even during an attack or when unable to act, you can consume MP to teleport nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.Can summon almost any enemy as an ally.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an enemy, they will drop an item (summon ball) that allows you to summon that enemy as an ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies do not drop items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.You can get weapons used by enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an enemy, the weapon they are using will drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies do not drop certain items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard, mouse, and gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad recommended.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Summons Sword: Pot Guardian&quot; is a top-down, highly challenging action game. Teleport to dodge enemy attacks, fight with swords and summoning magic, and recover the treasure &quot;Clay Pot of Darkness&quot; stolen by the evil summoner!",
